Step 6.4 is complete and committed as `83e9832`.

## What was done

**Envelope surfacing** (`shared/api/client.js` + `stores/workflow.js`)
- The API client now parses `{error:{code,message,details}}` on every non-OK response and throws an error carrying the backend's message, stable `code`, `status`, and `details` — falling back to the old raw-body format only for non-envelope failures (client.js:28-51).
- A store helper `apiErrorText(err, fallback)` formats surfaced errors as `message [CODE]`, applied to all 12 store API paths: node-types, open, save create/update, save-as, import, run, stop, execution refresh, run history — plus `refreshWorkflowList` and `loadTemplates`, which previously threw with no handling at all (workflow.js:1091-1111).

**Save gating on invalid JSON**
- New store registry: `reportInvalidField` / `clearInvalidFields` / `saveBlockedReason` (workflow.js:580-616). `saveWorkflow`/`saveAs` refuse without an API call while blocked, so the block isn't just button state.
- `ConfigField` emits `invalid` when its JSON textarea doesn't parse (and `null` on fix/unmount); `NodeInspector` registers it as `Fix invalid JSON in "<node>" → "<field>" before saving`, plus the workflow-variables editor. Blocks release exactly where the invalid text can disappear: fixed, field hidden, node deselected, inspector unmounted, or a new document loaded.
- Toolbar: Save/Save As/Duplicate disable with the reason shown as a red `role="alert"` hint in the toolbar (WorkflowPage.vue:717-721, 744-751).

**Number-widget desync fix** (ConfigField.vue:74-91)
- Clamped input that lands on the unchanged stored value, cleared input, and unparseable input all force the input element back to the value actually kept; `update` is emitted only when the value really changes.

**Verification**
- 26 new Vitest cases in `errorTruth.test.js`: client envelope parsing, all store surfacing paths, save gating at store/widget/inspector/page level, and number-widget sync. Full suite: 131 passed across 16 files; production build green. No backend code changed.

